---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="How It Works"
  kicker="How It Works"
  heading="From scattered records to a dependable system"
  lede="Every engagement follows the same readiness path — sized to your scope, whether you're a family or a 300-unit property."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Step 1</div>
          <h3>Records Health Check</h3>
          <p>We inventory what records exist, where they live, and who holds them — across paper, email, devices, cloud drives, software platforms, vendors, and agencies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Step 2</div>
          <h3>Missing-Record Report</h3>
          <p>We identify what's missing, what's unresolved, and which records are disconnected from the charges, payments, decisions, and events they should support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Step 3</div>
          <h3>Build the System</h3>
          <p>We build your folder structure, document index, proof-of-connection tables, and trackers on the PRC seven-category framework — dependable and retrievable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Step 4</div>
          <h3>Readiness Plan</h3>
          <p>You get a 30-, 60-, and 90-day plan: record requests to send, gaps to close, and continuity steps so operations survive any single point of failure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Step 5</div>
          <h3>Stay Ready</h3>
          <p>Optional monthly support keeps the system current: records organization, readiness reviews, annual health checks, and continuity memberships.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="kicker">Typical Deliverables</div>
        <h2>What you walk away with</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="list-check" style="columns: 2; column-gap: 3rem; max-width: 60rem;">
        <li>Transferred-record inventory</li>
        <li>Missing-record report</li>
        <li>Unresolved-item tracker</li>
        <li>Digital folder structure</li>
        <li>Document index</li>
        <li>Proof-of-connection table</li>
        <li>Open-maintenance and incident tracker</li>
        <li>30-, 60-, and 90-day transition plan</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 62ch;">
        Deliverables vary by service and written scope — number of entities, properties, units,
        accounts, transactions, documents, users, storage volume, and review complexity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
